Тогда-вид night_rt night, HardwareTraced: the interior lamps behind the glass in place, mean L of the glass area within ±25 % of night_pt, the second glass / bottles behind the window visible; profile-dump: "Translucency: Ray Traced Refraction" <= 1.0 ms, GPU frame <= +1.2 ms vs night_ss (D12)
